    28	
    29	| Key | Optimized default | Upstream/normal value | Notes |
    30	|---|---:|---:|---|
    31	| `ai_move_throttling_enabled` | `true` | `false` | `false` restores no-throttle AI movement requests. |
    32	| `ai_move_interval_ticks` | `4` | `1` | `1` disables AI cadence throttling. Larger values can reduce responsiveness. |
    33	| `egg_hatch_check_interval_ticks` | `20` | `20` | The pinned IoB 1.2.0 behavior already uses 20 ticks. Lower values change timing granularity and increase work. |
