     1	# Isle of Berk Performance Patches
     2	
     3	[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Vonix-Network/isleofberk-performance-patches?label=release)](https://github.com/Vonix-Network/isleofberk-performance-patches/releases)
