README.md:3:[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Vonix-Network/isleofberk-performance-patches?label=release)](https://github.com/Vonix-Network/isleofberk-performance-patches/releases)
README.md:8:A standalone Forge Mixin companion that applies Vonix performance patches to **Isle of Berk 1.2.0** on **Minecraft 1.18.2**.
README.md:10:> **This is a companion, not a fork or replacement.** Keep the original `isleofberk-1.2.0.jar` installed. This project does not redistribute Isle of Berk classes or resources and does not include the separate `isleofberk-deadlockfix` mod.
